{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25797","headline":"早渡扬子江 · 李绅","name":"早渡扬子江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日冲海浪翻银屋，江转秋波走雪山。\n青嶂迥开蹲虎戍，碧流潜伏跃龙关。\n地分吴楚星辰内，水迫沧溟宇宙间。\n焚却戍船无战伐，使知风教被乌蛮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25797.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25797","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}